{"id": "o3", "caption": "Warm brown knit over midi skirt with loafers", "pole": "tonal_column", "items": ["#198·30", "#76·26", "#451·30", "#295·18"], "day": "This outfit grounds the energetic session in warmth; the wool sweater and midi skirt match the morning temperature, while the leather loafers continue the leg line to the floor.", "deliberate": [{"item": "#451·30", "why": "Added as a top layer (blouse) to fix the 'no_top_bottom_or_dress' blocker and provide warmth for an outdoor walk.", "finding": "b-o3-1"}], "deliberate_2": [{"item": "#295·18", "why": "Added loafers in a chocolate tone that matches the sweater, fixing the leg line cut issue and providing footwear for the walk.", "finding": "f-o3-3,b-o3-2"}]},
{"id": "o4", "caption": "Linen palazzo set with silk blouse and loafers", "pole": "ease_the_knot", "items": ["#176·26", "#172·37"], "day": "The linen trousers handle the cool autumn air while allowing free movement for yoga; the fitted jacket adds structure without bulk. Added a chocolate silk blouse to fill the top slot and loafers for the walk.", "deliberate": [{"item": "#451·30", "why": "Added as a silk blouse to replace the formal blazer, shifting the look from 'smart' to 'home/everyday' suitable for yoga.", "finding": "f-o4-7,b-o4-2"}, {"item": "#194·09", "why": "Added chocolate loafers to fix the missing shoes and continue the leg line under the midi pants.", "finding": "b-o4-1,f-o4-2"}]},
